# ─── Uploads & generated reports ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anchored to repo-root/backend specifically (not bare "reports/") --
# unanchored matched backend/app/reports/ too, the source package for PDF/
# Excel report generation, silently swallowing new files added there
# (e.g. backend/app/reports/fonts/).
/uploads/
/reports/
backend/uploads/
backend/reports/

